WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.422 --> 00:00:04.764
Unit twenty-two. Evaluating AI Outputs!

2
00:00:05.689 --> 00:00:10.225
Hello, everyone! I'm Mr. Daniel, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:10.275 --> 00:00:13.818
Hi, Mr. Daniel! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.868 --> 00:00:18.246
Today we learn about Evaluating AI Outputs. Let's go!

5
00:00:20.129 --> 00:00:24.552
AI. Say it with me. AI!

6
00:00:28.085 --> 00:00:32.380
Hallucination. Say it with me. Hallucination!

7
00:00:35.884 --> 00:00:40.017
Accuracy. Say it with me. Accuracy!

8
00:00:43.517 --> 00:00:47.184
Source. Say it with me. Source!

9
00:00:50.702 --> 00:00:54.463
Bias. Say it with me. Bias!

10
00:00:57.961 --> 00:01:02.161
Verify. Say it with me. Verify!

11
00:01:05.675 --> 00:01:09.508
Evidence. Say it with me. Evidence!

12
00:01:12.938 --> 00:01:16.522
Judgment. Say it with me. Judgment!

13
00:01:20.032 --> 00:01:32.695
AI tools can produce a hallucination — confident but false information. Check accuracy against a reliable source, watch for bias, verify with evidence, and use your own judgment.

14
00:01:32.745 --> 00:01:36.444
Now I understand. Thank you, Mr. Daniel!

15
00:01:37.195 --> 00:01:42.608
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:42.658 --> 00:01:43.808
Accuracy!

17
00:01:44.996 --> 00:01:50.226
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:50.276 --> 00:01:51.426
Evidence!

19
00:01:52.388 --> 00:01:58.990
Did you know? AI 'hallucinations' can include made-up quotes, statistics and even book titles!

20
00:01:59.040 --> 00:02:01.421
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:02.593 --> 00:02:11.710
Think and answer. What would you do if an AI gave you a surprising fact?

22
00:02:11.760 --> 00:02:12.923
Great answer!

23
00:02:14.136 --> 00:02:19.593
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:19.643 --> 00:02:22.833
Goodbye, everyone! See you next time!

